            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>AVI BioPharma is developing AVI-4126, an antisense oligonucleotide targeted to c-myc mRNA for the potential treatment of restenosis, cancer and polycystic kidney disease. AVI-4126 is currently undergoing phase II clinical trials.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
